## Key Features

List the key features of your project.

Example:

1. Feature one
2. Feature two
3. Feature three

Write your features here:

1. **Document Ingestion** — Upload PDFs, DOCX files, URLs, plain text, and Slack threads directly into the knowledge base
2. **Natural Language Q&A with Citations** — Ask free-text questions and get grounded answers with source attribution and confidence scores
3. **Document Summarization** — Summarize any URL, ingested document, or Slack thread on demand
4. **Scoped Knowledge Layers** — Personal, team, and org-wide knowledge bases with automatic access control
5. **Multi-turn Conversation Memory** — Follow-up questions like "tell me more" work naturally with context retention
6. **Auto-tagging & Browsing** — Documents are auto-classified into categories (Engineering, HR, Finance, etc.) and browsable via `/browse`
7. **Out-of-scope Detection** — Two-level detection ensures the bot never hallucates and clearly says when an answer isn't available

